<p class="lede">HumAIn Logic (say it “human logic”) helps everyday people and small businesses use AI without stress. We put the human first.</p>
<p>We have four parts: a <a href="/tools">tool directory</a> with plain-language task search, a calm <a href="/news">AI news</a> feed, a <a href="/tracker">Job safety tracker</a>, and a weekly <a href="/newsletter">newsletter</a>.</p>
<h2 id="promise">Our promise</h2>
<ul><li>No company pays to be listed or ranked higher. There are no sponsored listings.</li><li>If we ever use affiliate links, every one carries a visible “Affiliate link” badge and never changes rankings.</li><li>We always show where facts come from, and when they were checked.</li><li>We label anything written with AI.</li><li>No pop-ups, no fear-bait, no hype.</li></ul>
